  "attributes": [
    {
      "id": 877033,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "value": "Final Fantasy VII redefined console role-playing games with its groundbreaking 3D graphics and compelling narrative. Players assume the role of Cloud Strife, a mercenary embroiled in a conflict against the powerful Shinra Corporation, which is draining the planet's life force, known as Mako. Alongside a diverse party of allies, including the skilled fighter Tifa Lockhart and the enigmatic Aerith Gainsborough, Cloud joins AVALANCHE, an eco-terrorist group fighting to stop Shinra’s destructive practices.\n\nThe game seamlessly blends exploration with strategic, turn-based battles utilizing the Active Time Battle (ATB) system. A unique Materia system allows for extensive character customization, granting new abilities, spells, and statistical boosts. Players navigate a vast world, traversing environments via vehicles and chocobos, uncovering secrets, and engaging in memorable event games. The game’s narrative explores themes of environmentalism, identity, and loss, culminating in a deeply emotional and impactful storyline, including a pivotal character death that remains iconic in gaming history. Final Fantasy VII offers a rich, immersive experience that set a new standard for the RPG genre."
    },
